 strong operational execution, a theme I will discuss in more detail on today's call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2018 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2018-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"EBITDA margin was negatively impacted by the anticipated revenue decline and more competitively priced backlog, offset, in part, by merger synergies and other cost reduction initiatives achieved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2018 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Pferdehirt","x":"Our results were further supported by the delivery of merger and other cost savings initiatives, and we remain on track to generate $450 million in annualized merger savings by the end of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/technipfmc-plc-fti-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2018 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"Finally, we incurred charges and credits totaling $37.3 million for restructuring and other severance charges, business combination charges, and purchase price accounting adjustment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/technipfmc-plc-fti-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"So all in all, really a positive business restructuring for Onshore/Offshore to allow them to more effectively compete in a particular jurisdiction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/technipfmc-plc-fti-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2019-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Pferdehirt","x":"So we will get the margins back up, but we did have to lower the full year guidance and that was lowered as a result of the market activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/technipfmc-plc-fti-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"Total after-tax charges and credits were $78.6 million, primarily related to legal provisions, business integration costs and severance charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"Will there be -- will this leads to further restructuring or not, I'll leave that up to our competitors, but I'll tell what we're glad we did ours back in 2017 versus considering something like that right now at this point in the growth cycle of our major markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"The strength of these results and significant growth in backlog across all segments gives us even greater confidence that we will achieve our increased full year guidance and provides us with improved visibility as we look to 2020 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"We think it's the right place to increase the guidance to -- for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"Secondly, is we are looking -- we will be moving forward with further restructuring simply to reflect the new market reality and that is under way and that will continue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2019 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2019-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"For corporate expense, we're increasing our full-year guidance to a range of $210 million to $215 million versus our previous guidance of $160 million to $170 million, excluding the impact of FX.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"Second, on April 1st, we announced a series of cost reduction initiatives that will result in an annualized savings of at least $130 million from our Surface Technologies segment and Corporate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/technipfmc-fti-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"We are taking additional actions to further streamline our organization in support of our vision toward simplification, standardization and reduce cycle times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/technipfmc-fti-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"Our strong balance sheet and liquidity position and our extensive backlog have also provided us with the flexibility to accelerate our business transformation, with global actions under way to generate annualized cost savings in excess of 350 million by year-end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/technipfmc-fti-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"We continue to right size our assets to better align with our differentiated offering and the advantages of new technologies, such as Subsea 2.0 and integrated project delivery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/technipfmc-fti-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2020-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Maryann Mannen","x":"Underlying corporate expense have improved over the last three consecutive quarters, giving us confidence to lower our full-year guidance, which I'll come back to in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/technipfmc-fti-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Wilson","x":"And those revenues will still pass through the top line and the MRL as you work off the warranty?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/technipfmc-fti-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"And looking at our business transformation, we continue to accelerate our cost reduction efforts and have already achieved the full targeted run rate savings of more than $350 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/technipfmc-fti-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"As we leverage our new business models, innovative technologies and digital solutions, we will continue to drive further cost reduction and efficiency gains across the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/technipfmc-fti-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2020-10-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"Taken together, our inbound orders, our operational results and our cost reduction initiatives provide us the confidence to reaffirm our full-year guidance for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/technipfmc-fti-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"Our aggressive cost-reduction plan, focus on project execution, and resilient backlog provided us the confidence and visibility to issue guidance at a time when few others in the energy sector were willing to guide for the next quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/technipfmc-fti-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2020 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"Beyond the separation, we also accelerated our cost-reduction efforts across the entire company in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/technipfmc-fti-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2021 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"So Michael, I'm not gonna announce a big massive cost-reduction program or something like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/technipfmc-fti-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2021 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"…we recognized charges and credits that netted to an expense of $16 million and included the following items: Expenses totaling $44 million related to impairment, restructuring and other charges, primarily related to a $37 million noncash impairment to our initial investment in Magma Global.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/technipfmc-fti-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2021 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2022-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"These charges included the following: expenses totaling $42 million related to impairment, restructuring, and other charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/24/technipfmc-fti-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2021 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2022-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"Corporate expense was $30 million, which included $2 million of restructuring and other charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/24/technipfmc-fti-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2022 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"These charges included the following: expenses totaling $1 million related to impairment, restructuring, and other charges; and a loss of $29 million on our equity ownership in Technip Energies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/technipfmc-fti-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2022 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"Corporate expense was $30 million, which included $3 million of restructuring and other charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/technipfmc-fti-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2022 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"We have reaffirmed our 2022 guidance as all items remain within the ranges previously provided to help you -- to help in your modeling for the remainder of the year, I will provide some additional color on the segment guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/technipfmc-fti-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2022 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2022-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"We have reduced our guidance for capital expenditures by 50 million to approximately 180 million for the full year, primarily driven by timing of vessel recertifications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/27/technipfmc-fti-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2022 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2022-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"So, first of all, you are right that, you know, we reiterated guidance for Subsea at the midpoint, and we did indicate that Surface would be a little bit lighter on the full year guidance for the EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/27/technipfmc-fti-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2023-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"This early client engagement allows for the highest degree of integration, innovation, and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/technipfmc-plc-fti-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2023-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"Adjusted EBITDA was 40 million, a 9% decrease primarily due to the lower international activity, partially offset by cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/technipfmc-plc-fti-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2023-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"The impact of the previously disclosed legal settlement and restructuring and other charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/27/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2023-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"With a strong inbound success in the period, Subsea orders for the first half of the year totaled $6.7 billion, and today we are increasing our full-year outlook for 2023 Subsea orders to reach $9 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/27/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"EBITDA was $284 million when excluding foreign exchange loss of $46 million and impairment restructuring and other charges totaling $4 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/26/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Pferdehirt","x":"And if they're not, then we're able to continue to streamline our -- improve our returns by streamlining our fixed cost base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/26/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2023-10-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"First, given the strong Q3 results and improved outlook for Q4, we are increasing our guidance for full year company EBITDA to approximately $950 million when excluding foreign exchange.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/26/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2023 Q4","e":"fti","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"EBITDA was $245 million, when excluding foreign exchange loss of $26 million and restructuring impairment and other charges totaling $10 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/22/technipfmc-plc-fti-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q1","e":"fti","d":"2024-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"EBITDA was $257 million, when excluding a gain on the sale of our measurement solutions business of $75 million; restructuring, impairment, and other charges totaling $5 million, and a foreign exchange loss of $4 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2024-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"EBITDA was $379 million when excluding a foreign exchange loss of $18 million and restructuring impairment and other charges totaling $2 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2024-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"In Subsea, we are increasing our guidance range for both revenue and adjusted EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q2","e":"fti","d":"2024-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"Given this higher level of financial performance, we are also increasing our guidance range for free cash flow to now be in a range of $425 million to $575 million, which includes the P&F payments approximating $170 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/25/technipfmc-plc-fti-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2024-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alf Melin","x":"EBITDA was $389 million when excluding restructuring, impairment and other charges totaling $4 million and a foreign exchange loss of $3 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/24/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2024-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas J. Pferdehirt","x":"In closing, we are clearly demonstrating our ability to execute on our expanding backlog as evidenced by our year-to-date results and increased guidance for Subsea in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/24/technipfmc-plc-fti-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FTI 2024 Q3","e":"fti","d":"2024-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Waqar Syed","x":"First of all, congrats on a great quarter and for rais